# One line ending in the repository, whatever the checkout does locally.
# Windows checkouts get CRLF in the working tree; git stores LF. Without this
# a Windows commit can flip a whole file to CRLF and show 3,000 changed lines
# for a two-line edit (it happened to public/css/style.css in v1.51.0).
* text=auto

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
